<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>여론조사 플랫폼 | 실시간 투표 시스템</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-gradient-start: #667eea;
      --bg-gradient-end: #764ba2;
      --card-bg: white;
      --text-color: #333;
      --secondary-text: #666;
      --feature-bg: #f8f9fa;
      --button-shadow: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4);
    }
    
    [data-theme="dark"] {
      --bg-gradient-start: #1a1a2e;
      --bg-gradient-end: #16213e;
      --card-bg: #2d2d2d;
      --text-color: #e0e0e0;
      --secondary-text: #aaa;
      --feature-bg: #3a3a3a;
      --button-shadow: rgba(13, 110, 253, 0.4);
    }
    
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-gradient-start) 0%, var(--bg-gradient-end) 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      transition: background 0.3s ease;
    }
    
    .landing-container {
      max-width: 700px; /* 기존 900px*/
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    
    /* 히어로 섹션 */
    .hero-section {
      text-align: center;
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: 30px;
      padding: 60px 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: 8px 20px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.3);
    }
    
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text-color);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }
    
    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: var(--secondary-text);
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    
    .cta-button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 18px 45px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 50px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      text-decoration: none;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px var(--button-shadow);
    }
    
    .cta-button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 40px var(--button-shadow);
      color: white;
    }
    
    .cta-icon {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      animation: bounce 2s infinite;
    }
    
    @keyframes bounce {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-5px); }
    }
    
    /* 기능 섹션 */
    .features-section {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); /* 기존 250px*/
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }
    
    .feature-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 35px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }
    
    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    
    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      display: block;
    }
    
    .feature-title {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-color);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    
    .feature-desc {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--secondary-text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    
    /* 부가 액션 버튼 */
    .secondary-actions {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }
    
    .secondary-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 12px 30px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: transparent;
      color: white;
      border: 2px solid white;
      border-radius: 50px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 10px;
    }
    
    .secondary-btn:hover {
      background: white;
      color: var(--bg-gradient-start);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }
    
    /* 다크모드 토글 */
    .dark-mode-toggle {
      position: fixed;
      top: 20px;
      right: 20px;
      z-index: 1050;
    }
    
    .toggle-btn {
      background-color: var(--card-bg);
      border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      border-radius: 50px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      color: var(--text-color);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }
    
    .toggle-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }
    
    .toggle-icon {
      font-size: 20px;
    }
    
    /* 반응형 */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero-title {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
      }
      
      .hero-subtitle {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }
      
      .hero-section {
        padding: 40px 25px;
      }
      
      .cta-button {
        padding: 15px 35px;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }
      
      .features-section {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      
      .secondary-btn {
        display: flex;
        margin: 10px 0;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- 다크모드 토글 버튼 -->
  <div class="dark-mode-toggle">
    <button class="toggle-btn" onclick="toggleDarkMode()">
      <span class="toggle-icon" id="themeIcon">🌙</span>
      <span id="themeText">다크</span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- 메인 콘텐츠 -->
  <div class="landing-container">
    <!-- 히어로 섹션 -->
    <div class="hero-section">
      <div class="hero-badge">🎯 실시간 투표 시스템</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">빠르고 쉬운<br>여론조사</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        누구나 쉽게 만들고, 실시간으로 결과를 확인할 수 있는<br>
        스마트한 여론조사 플랫폼
      </p>
      <a href="/polls/new" class="cta-button">
        <span class="cta-icon">🚀</span>
        <span>지금 시작하기</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- 기능 섹션 -->
    <div class="features-section">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">⚡</span>
        <h3 class="feature-title">실시간 결과</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">투표 결과가 실시간으로 업데이트되어 즉각적인 피드백을 받을 수 있어요</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">🔒</span>
        <h3 class="feature-title">중복 방지</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">IP 기반 중복 투표 방지로 공정하고 정확한 투표 결과를 보장해요</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">📊</span>
        <h3 class="feature-title">지역별 통계</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">투표자의 지역 정보를 자동으로 수집하여 상세한 통계를 제공해요</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 부가 액션 -->
    <div class="secondary-actions">
      <a href="/polls" class="secondary-btn">
        <span>📋</span>
        <span>여론조사 둘러보기</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  
  <script>
    // 다크모드 함수들
    function initDarkMode() {
      const savedTheme = localStorage.getItem('theme') || 'light';
      document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', savedTheme);
      updateThemeIcon(savedTheme);
    }

    function toggleDarkMode() {
      const currentTheme = document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-theme');
      const newTheme = currentTheme === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark';
      
      document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', newTheme);
      localStorage.setItem('theme', newTheme);
      updateThemeIcon(newTheme);
    }

    function updateThemeIcon(theme) {
      const icon = document.getElementById('themeIcon');
      const text = document.getElementById('themeText');
      
      if (icon && text) {
        if (theme === 'dark') {
          icon.textContent = '☀️';
          text.textContent = '라이트';
        } else {
          icon.textContent = '🌙';
          text.textContent = '다크';
        }
      }
    }

    // 즉시 다크모드 초기화
    initDarkMode();
  </script>
</body>
</html>